  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1sFio8F.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>Fancy Block Particles</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">是一款客戶端模組，能將原版 Minecraft 中的基礎 2D 粒子轉變為酷炫的 <strong>3D 動畫粒子</strong>！</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這是改造自 MorphoxL 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-block-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fancy Block Particles</a> 模組，並移植至最新版本的 Minecraft。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>說明</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組在遊戲中引入了 3D 粒子，讓您可以根據個人喜好靈活調整其設定。如果您不喜歡某些粒子，可以減少其數量或完全停用。一旦停用（透過 FBP 面板），將顯示標準的原版粒子。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>本模組僅應安裝在客戶端！</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>是的，您可以在您的模組包中使用此模組！</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>粒子與動畫</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>方塊放置動畫與破壞粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H0q8pHN.gif\" alt=\"方塊破壞\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>火焰、岩漿、煙霧與營火煙霧粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JcIIAkj.gif\" alt=\"火焰與煙霧\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>螢火蟲粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0xYnkah.gif\" alt=\"螢火蟲\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>滴落粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24RpkCg.gif\" alt=\"滴落\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>雨水粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7VDUAkF.gif\" alt=\"雨水\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>雪花粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5NnVa7.gif\" alt=\"雪花\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>設定</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FBP 讓您可以根據喜好自訂最關鍵的破壞粒子設定。若要開啟 FBP 面板，請按鍵盤上的 <strong>I</strong> 鍵（預設）。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RPdhY21.png\" alt=\"選單\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您也可以透過設定檔進行調整，檔案位於 <strong><em>config/fbp/config.json</em></strong>，視需要修改即可。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>按鍵綁定</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟用/停用模組&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未綁定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟用/停用放置動畫&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未綁定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開啟設定&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>I</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">切換凍結效果&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>R</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">移除粒子&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未綁定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速將方塊加入黑名單&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>X</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速將手持方塊加入黑名單&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>Shift + X</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">重新載入設定&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未綁定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>OptiFine/Iris 相容性</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FBP <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">應</span>與 OptiFine 和 Iris 相容。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您發現僅在使用 FBP 搭配 OptiFine、Iris 或其他光影模組時出現的錯誤，請<a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此</a>回報。<strong>但</strong>請注意，並非所有這類問題都能解決！</span></p><p></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>下載</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.21.11&amp;showAlphaFiles=show\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.16.5</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要尋找更舊版本或原始模組，請前往<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-block-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</span></p><p></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>貢獻</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>發現錯誤？</strong>請<a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此</a>回報，我會盡力修復！</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>有新功能的想法？</strong>請<a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=enhancement&amp;template=feature_request.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此</a>告訴我更多細節！</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>程式碼</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊我</a>查看</span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>原始碼</strong>！<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#333;font-size:14px\">「如果你想使用我的程式碼，請隨意，但記得提及這是誰的程式碼！</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#333;font-size:14px\">保重，作者。」</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>贊助</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fhantonik\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.buymeacoffee.com/button-api/?text=請我喝杯咖啡&amp;emoji=&amp;slug=hantonik&amp;button_colour=BD5FFF&amp;font_colour=ffffff&amp;font_family=Comic&amp;outline_colour=000000&amp;coffee_colour=FFDD00\"></a></p><p><strong>我出於熱忱而創作</strong>，但如果您想感謝我的努力，可以透過<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fhantonik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">請我喝杯咖啡</a>來表示，<strong>謝謝 &lt;3</strong>！</p>",
